        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**No parking available**\n\nSwiss Cottage has recently been awarded a WiredScore Silver rating under the residential certification by WiredScore, the internationally recognised real estate rating scheme for digital connectivity. The WiredScore rating reflects the buildings' excellent connectivity offering.\n\nSwiss Cottage by havitat presents a development comprising 110 apartments, and lifestyle enhancing amenities, for a new way of renting. \n\nSwiss Cottage is located in the heart of Santry - a neighbourhood surrounded by acres of green parkland where your everyday needs are within easy walking distance - great shops and restaurants, sports and leisure facilities, parks, and schools. Santry combines neighbourhood living with the convenience of excellent travel links into the city centre and is only minutes from major employment hubs such as Northwood, Beaumont Hospital, Dublin Airport and convenient to the Port Tunnel, M1 and M50.\n\nApartments at Swiss Cottage are designed to the highest standard. They offer open plan living /dining areas, large bedrooms, and balconies - many with with unobstructed views across Dublin City and Bay. The apartments are contemporary in style and furnished to a luxury level. \n\nThe dedicated lifestyle amenities at Swiss Cottage really set it apart and showcase how the development facilitates modern living. \n\nApartment Perks:\n\n- Fully Furnished (contemporary style)\n- Modern Appliances\n- Integrated Kitchen \n- Smart Energy Meter \n- Landlord provided High Speed Internet in apartments (100MB)* \n- Onsite Repairs\n- Pet Friendly* \n- A2/A3 BER rating\n- Majority with balcony/winter garden\n\nBuilding Perks* \n\n- Multipurpose bookable amenity room with kitchen \n- Private media room / Cinema room \n- Roof terrace area with seating, exclusively for residents' use \n- Residents' lounge\n- Parcel delivery facility \n- Coffee dock\n- Fully equipped state of the art Gym\n- Free Wi-Fi throughout the amenity spaces \n- Landscaped courtyard\n- Bicycle storage\n- Community events \n- Club Car exclusively for residents' use **\n- Secure storage lockers (subject to separate charge)\n- CCTV\n- Online residents' portal \n- Recycling facilities\n- Secure access control \n- Environmental waste disposal\n- Club Car exclusively for residents' use (coming soon) - subject to hourly rental fee payable directly to the Club Car Provider\n\n** Subject to hourly rental fee payable directly to the Club Car Provider\n\nThe dedicated team appointed by havitat for Swiss Cottage is on hand to assist with any queries you may have to ensure everything runs smoothly in your new home. We look forward to welcoming you for a viewing. \n\n*** Please note photos may not be specific to this apartment but all apartments are finished to similar standard\n\n**** Please note apartment size is based on the average size, the size of actual apartments may differ."
      },
